                          </g>
                        </svg>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="testimonial-details-wrap">
                    <h3 class="testimonia-title">Outstanding Strategic Business Guidance</h3>
                    <div class="testimonial-line"></div>
                    <p class="body-text-md text-color-gray">Clavix completely transformed how we approach business strategy. Their insights were practical, data-driven, and directly improved our decision-making process. We’ve seen consistent growth since working with them.</p>
